<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Depending on ritual quality, participants will get between {MINMOOD} and {MAXMOOD} mood for {MOODDAYS} days. -->
  <AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.description>参与者将在{MOODDAYS}天内获得{MINMOOD}到{MAXMOOD}的心情值，这取决于仪式的效果。</AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.description>
  <!-- EN: moral guide present -->
  <AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.comps.0.label>传道者出席</AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.comps.0.label>
  <!-- EN: participant count -->
  <AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.comps.1.label>参与者数量</AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.comps.1.label>
  <!-- EN: The {RITUAL} spectacular! We salvaged a lot of useful body parts. -->
  <AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.modExtensions.0.bestOutcomeDesc>{RITUAL}非常完美！我们获得了许多有用的血肉重塑部件。</AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.modExtensions.0.bestOutcomeDesc>
  <!-- EN: The {RITUAL} was a disaster! The butchering of {CORPSE} was sloppy, and we couldn't recover any healthy organs. -->
  <AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.modExtensions.0.worstOutcomeDesc>{RITUAL}糟糕透顶！{CORPSE}被分解的七零八落，我们无法从中获得任何完好的血肉重塑部件。</AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.modExtensions.0.worstOutcomeDesc>
  <!-- EN: Terrible -->
  <AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>糟糕的</AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.0.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was terrible! The speaker just botched the whole operation and we couldn't recover any healthy organs. What a mess. -->
  <AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>{0}非常糟糕！演讲者把死者分解的七零八落，我们无法从中获得任何完好的血肉重塑部件。这可真是一团糟！</AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.0.description>
  <!-- EN: Lackluster -->
  <AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>枯燥乏味的</AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.1.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was lackluster. The speech was long-winded and did not honour them. At least we got some useful body parts out of the whole fiasco. -->
  <AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>{0}枯燥乏味。演讲冗长且无趣，没有体现出对死者应有的尊重。不过至少我们还是从中获得了一点有用的血肉重塑部件。</AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.1.description>
  <!-- EN: Good -->
  <AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>令人满意的</AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.2.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was good. The speaker's final words provided a path for everyone to move on. We got some useful body parts out of our fallen colleague. -->
  <AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>{0}令人满意。演讲者的结束语为大家指明了前进的道路。我们从死者身上获得了一些有用的血肉重塑部件。</AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.2.description>
  <!-- EN: Amazing -->
  <AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>令人惊异的</AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.3.label>
  <!-- EN: The {0} was heartwarming. The speech was captivating and heartfelt, and everyone came away focused on good memories. We salvaged many body parts and our fallen colleague will be forever part of us, in some cases literally. -->
  <AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>{0}令人惊异。演讲感人肺腑，大家渐渐放下了对死者的挂念，并从悲伤之中走了出来。我们从死者身上获得了许多有用的血肉重塑部件。</AM_FleshCraftingFuneralOutcome.outcomeChances.3.description>
  
</LanguageData>